<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's Vulcan changes par value.</title>
<headline>Manila's Vulcan changes par value.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration firm Vulcan Industrial Mining Corp said on Thursday the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) has approved the change in the par value of its shares to one peso from 0.01 peso per share.</p>
<p>In an advisory, Vulcan said the change will be reflected in the stock exchange's computer system on June 23.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
